{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20335","headline":"卧疾 · 张籍","name":"卧疾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身病始知道，卧读神农经。\n空房夜留灯，四壁青荧荧。\n羇旅逐人欢，贫贱还自轻。\n今来问良医，乃知病所生。\n僮仆各相忧，杵臼无停声。\n见我形憔悴，劝药语丁宁。\n春雨枕席冷，窗前新禽鸣。\n开门起无力，遥爱鷄犬行。\n服药察耳目，渐觉如酒醒。\n方悟养生者，不为忧患并。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}